  "title": "Pretzel Dogs",
  "description": "Soft pretzel dough is rolled around hot dogs, sprinkled with salt and baked until golden brown. Now you can experience the pretzel dogs from the mall at home!",
  "authors": [
    "modifiedgirl"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:44:32-04:00",
