  "ingredients": [
    "2 (.25 ounce) packages active dry yeast",
    "2.5 teaspoons white sugar",
    "2 cups warm water",
    "2 cups warm milk",
    "0.5 cup vegetable oil",
    "1.5 teaspoons salt",
    "10 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 teaspoons baking soda",
    "2 (16 ounce) packages hot dogs",
    "0.25 cup coarse kosher salt, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1zxqEnkkzBGiIz0--MNjBmrvkGY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217282-pretzel-dogs-VAT-005-step-01-0ffde6a1fc4841b39f5849e93d1e7e92.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217282/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle the yeast and sugar over 2 cups of warm water in a small bowl. The water should be no more than 100 degrees F (40 degrees C). Let stand for 20 minutes until the yeast softens and begins to form a creamy foam.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/syfe7ZtYEfBP4n-iMAbCN1bx1wY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217282-pretzel-dogs-VAT-006-step-02-517bb650792d46fbb6cd9bcbf324d220.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217282/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine the yeast mixture with the warm milk, oil, and salt in a large mixing bowl; stir well to combine. Stir in half of the flour mixture until no dry spots remain. Stir in the remaining flour, 1 cup at a time, mixing well after each addition. The dough should be moderately stiff and slightly sticky.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/n_Qytzv-VpJ_DxOBMDUZ_vKPwqU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217282-pretzel-dogs-VAT-007-step-03-fd2c695e72c84059a1cfb88d585011d5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217282/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the dough has pulled together, turn it out onto a lightly floured surface and knead until smooth and elastic, about 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i9-Ur_pwuLxvltt4an6pIJ8nzpA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217282-pretzel-dogs-VAT-008-step-04-d1005477b14843688b9b26a9fead64f5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217282/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spray a large bowl with cooking spray, then place the dough in the bowl and turn to coat. Cover with plastic wrap or a light cloth and let rise in a warm place (80 to 95 degrees F (27 to 35 degrees C)) until doubled in volume, about 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YsJmkyRP8KvfYFv7EfnYy-Mqs0I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217282-pretzel-dogs-VAT-009-step-05-f3808cb4ddb54751a006a02e7583ce3f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217282/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "After the dough has risen, fill a large pot with about 8 cups water, 1 1/2 teaspoons salt, and the baking soda and bring to a rolling boil over high heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/goe0Y6-30plPRnLAuVzRg9RHKp8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217282-pretzel-dogs-VAT-011-step-06-1eb30902b8bd48399b044c402f8d85d2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217282/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the water is coming to a boil cut the the dough into 20 pieces, about the size of a golf ball. Roll each piece into a 12 inch long rope about 1 1/2 inches thick.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UUHts0yvCNx4KsF864EbBQJiZSs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217282-pretzel-dogs-VAT-010-step-07-6113451c1bc24f18997b731703357455.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217282/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Lightly grease 2 baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HFz_ONBWbSmrEaC-8maQunsms_E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217282-pretzel-dogs-VAT-012-step-08-d05272e1e1cb478c87d97c913dbe9778.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217282/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip a strip of dough into the boiling water using a pair of tongs, count to 5, remove it from the water, and place it on a paper towel for a few seconds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9Uc34Tns0pD1r3TmAxtAQedpn5E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217282-pretzel-dogs-VAT-013-step-09-6fca1768004a443391a1741bb33ac5c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217282/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wrap the strip around a hot dog, place on a baking sheet, and sprinkle with coarse salt. Repeat with the remaining strips of dough and hot dogs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M4DMvNsMpwvi-jKJgRBmpbizsiY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217282-pretzel-dogs-VAT-014-step-10-5babf0fc60ea4ddbb5cb13e010c2def5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217282/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in a preheated oven until they are golden brown, about 15 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HqBfRqT_kn5OC1OIu6mGP0gzMq4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217282-pretzel-dogs-VAT-015-step-11-1aac179d458c47b7ab51f857ee2fdd57.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217282/step_11.webp"
    }
  ],
